>> Animal := Ahanoa hou.
Animal ina-tae: ['sound:'] mahia: { :s ake sound := s. }.
Animal ina-tae: ['makeSound'] mahia: { Huaputa tuhi: ake sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal hou.
Cat ina-tae: ['init'] mahia: { ake sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat ina-tae: ['meow'] mahia: { whaiaro makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
